-        // C:\foo\bar into /C:\foo\bar (and then percent encoding turns it into
-        // /C:/foo/bar). In the network share case, this turns \share\foo\bar
-        // into /\share/foo/bar (and then percent encoding turns it into
-        // //share/foo/bar).
